    mem-track           configure memory tracking
    prepare-shutdown    prepare for shutdown
    profile-foe         run Purity in profile mode on next restart
    release-foe         run Purity in release mode on next restart
    restart             restart Purity
    start               start Purity
    status              status Purity
    stop                stop Purity
    tune                set or clear tunables
    multitune           set or clear multiple tunables
    wait                wait for Purity services to become ready

